    "synopsis": {
        "native": "D\u00e9but des ann\u00e9es 70, sur une base de l\u2019arm\u00e9e fran\u00e7aise \u00e0 Madagascar, les militaires et leurs familles vivent les derni\u00e8res illusions du colonialisme.",
        "english": "At the beginning of the 70s, in Madagascar, a few armed forces and their families live in one of the last French military bases abroad, a relic of the ending French colonial empire. Influenced by his reading of the intrepid comic book heroine Fant\u00f4mette, Thomas, a ten-year-old boy, sweeps with a curious glance what surrounds him. Beneath the carefree expatriate life, his eyes are gradually opening to another reality."
